    "summary": "--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- Marvell Technology, Inc. (NASDAQ: MRVL), a leader in data infrastructure semiconductor solutions, today announced it will showcase its comprehensive portfolio of AI data center infrastructure solutions at OCP Global Summit 2026, October 12 to 15 at the San Jose McEnery Convention center in San Jose, California. Backed by an extensive technology partner ecosystem, Marvell is enabling customers to scale their AI infrastructure with design flexibility and operational efficiency, while maximizing performance, scalability, interoperability and power efficiency. Trusted by the world’s leading technology companies for over 30 years, we move, store, process and secure the world’s data with semiconductor solutions designed for our customers’ current needs and future ambitions.",
